ab29a770", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e6ea8505/uploads/origins/cdb4d03c-a470-4e83-b63b-1664e1dfa0a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=79070db9911bbb1f59b828b5ab29a770, https://si.imgix.net/e6ea8505/uploads/origins/cdb4d03c-a470-4e83-b63b-1664e1dfa0a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c381a903aece81875128cd42bdd81d5f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e6ea8505/uploads/origins/cdb4d03c-a470-4e83-b63b-1664e1dfa0a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93a54e24e83e565c0344120038746fe0 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I found your art and I think is awesome. I would like to request one of my OCs: Kumomi, she is a human-yokai hybrid, based on a spider, instead of having a spider body she got a human body with 2 extra arms. She is a gyaru at heart with a mesugaki attitude and is a very flirtatious person. She has 8 eyes divided in 2 main eyes which are the source of her sign, the other 6 eyes are for assistance and perception, 4 eyes above the main eyes and 2 eyes located at the bottom corner of the main eyes, she does not have eyebrows. Her eyes have a purple sclera with a slid red pupil, SHe has fangs that inject venom, but her venoms work as an aphrodisiac\n\nShe has wild purple hair that is naturally in 2 tones, a dark purple color on the outside part and a brighter color on the inside, with long bangs that cover all her eyes and 2 longer side bangs as fashion, she usually doesn't show her eyes unless she wants to intimidate or seduce someone. She has hair on her wrists that looks like fluffy bracelets, but this is natural hair that helps her perceive the environment like regular spiders, and she also have a spider silk appendage that grows on the bottom part of her spine.\n\nShe tends to use her spider silk when in intimacy with someone (if that person is inclined for those kind of games), when she gets bored and uses some silk to play with it, or when defending herself. Her dad is a Judo master, and she trained with him, but she designed a variant that uses judo and bondage with her silk.\n\nShe has small breast, but has strong legs as she was part of the track and field club, she is very athletic and being part of this club and her spider lineage, gave her beautiful long legs with wide hips and a well-defined butt and abs. She was admired by her club colleagues, specially by women\n\nAge: 21\nHeight: 170 cm\nBreast: 85 cm\nWaist: 63 cm\nHips: 100 cm\n\nAlthough she is 21 in the reference sheet, could I ask if you draw her as a 16-year-old student. She is training for her next competition. Could you please draw her wearing her track and field uniform. Please feel free to alter it to match your style. Please feel free to choose pose expression and in case you would like to alter her hairstyle please do. I would like to give you artistic freedom\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mqSLBmalb0lYQx-rdci8lDRrOYLNENYH?usp=sharing\n\nThank you very much\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mqSLBmalb0lYQx-rdci8lDRrOYLNENYH?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@UFOhitori/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3743554, "client_id": 4080411, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b0b0507/uploads/origins/cd5675a9-2506-443d-b43d-c704ec69e2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b0ab4897937bc1b4fdc9b09c0f2ed8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b0b0507/uploads/origins/cd5675a9-2506-443d-b43d-c704ec69e2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b0ab4897937bc1b4fdc9b09c0f2ed8, https://si.imgix.net/8b0b0507/uploads/origins/cd5675a9-2506-443d-b43d-c704ec69e2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=